{"version":1,"key":"card:254","content":{"id":254,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"字符串有几个接受正则表达式的方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"match(regex)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"replace(regex, replacement)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"search(regex)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"split(regex)","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在 ES6 允许使用对象来代替上面的正则表达式(regex)，从而可以自定义匹配行为。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为例，当字符串调用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法传入一个对象时，会调用对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，并将自己作为参数传入，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的返回结果作为字符串 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的返回结果"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const obj = {\n  [Symbol.match]: function (str) {\n    return str.length === 10 ? [\"Hello Alice!\"] : null;\n  },\n};\nlet str = \"HelloWorld\".match(obj);\n\nconsole.log(str); // [ 'Hello Alice!' ]","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"65c1741f-258a-4b06-841f-ecfbd2e17078","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他的三个方法 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"replace","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"search","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"split","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分别对应于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.replace","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.search","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.split","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其使用方法与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"match","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类似。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690986949582,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}